colour25.h264 contains 50 synthetic 128x96 progressive pictures at 25 fps.
It contains no external video, photographs, audio or other source media.

Created with FFmpeg 6.1.1 and libx264 using this command:

ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc2=size=128x96:rate=25 -frames:v 50 -an \
  -c:v libx264 -threads 1 -preset medium -crf 18 \
  -x264-params keyint=25:min-keyint=25:scenecut=0:aud=1 colour25.h264

